	(descr "Atlas Scientific EC OEM (OEM-EC) embedded conductivity circuit, 10 castellated pins. Land pattern per EC OEM datasheet v3.4 Recommended pad layout (p.35): pads 2.5 x 1.4 mm, 12 mm row centre to centre, 2.3 mm pitch (same values as the pH/ORP OEM datasheets and feather_orp Atlas_ORP_OEM). Body 12 x 11.9 mm (p.5). Pads: 1 SDA, 2 NC, 3 VCC, 4 PRB, 5 PRB, 6 GND, 7 INT, 8 SCL, 9 NC, 10 NC. Datasheet p.34: no vias or exposed metal under the OEM (rule area included).")
